{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_1000_p", "source_sha256": "17b9cfbaaf26d22b609547de913852b378f40f2c824fe0bf0a32d8a40656ac06", "ja": "（新しいライブハウスでの公演後、『≡君彩≡』の\nCDが完売。再プレスされる事になった）", "zh": "（在新开的Live House演出后，《≡君彩≡》的CD售罄了。现在决定再次压制发行）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1bd0014e63c99e12fe7c19358ee2a629d5d371a7434ce2b77139c9b43b91d506", "ja": "（今日は可奈と、その販売イベントに来ているけど……\n少し緊張しているみたいだな）", "zh": "（今天和可奈一起来参加那个贩售活动，不过……她好像有点紧张啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "f752d7b91fb8f8260b84e89d0539a09d55372025ab5ce1cd5b002b667c81f382", "ja": "きょ、今日は絶対失敗しないぞ～♪　大丈夫だぞ～♪\n……でもでも、挨拶の練習をしておこうかな？", "zh": "今、今天绝对不会失败～♪ 没问题的～♪\n……不过不过，还是先练习一下打招呼吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "e4f9cfacf00f5aca9cc3f0a71d303f58a2bf975bb6b2e828a5e2968a8aba060c", "ja": "って、はれ？　メモが……ない？\nたしかカバンに……あああっ！？", "zh": "咦，咦？备忘录……不见了？\n我记得明明放在包里……啊啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "3ba2c31e46d780416fd2d7e59689bc953e4917c625daa6d00007b780f8b7fb1f", "ja": "寝る前まで考えてて、机の上に置いてきちゃった……。\nどどっ、どうしましょう{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我一直想到睡前，结果落在桌子上了……\n怎、怎怎、怎么办啊{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0f5378f71e00416c8a75d2743ec0cf26216a424001963dec2d9043c8e2c20a85", "ja": "うん、そうだな。とりあえず……。", "zh": "嗯，这样啊。总之先……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_1006", "source_sha256": "97778c3d7f187a23d2463cb35f1ab3cc87badf43b6c693deb4768f0ece03b44b", "ja": "落ち着いて", "zh": "冷静下来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2000_p", "source_sha256": "0bc5350837da970ec770ccf51e41729b12eae864b97a2ee39a8bf36be397056b", "ja": "慌てなくても大丈夫だ。\n開始までは、まだ時間があるし……。", "zh": "不用慌，没关系的。\n距离开始还有时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2001_p", "source_sha256": "d2a8aef32370163d771d45328f07582b805de22c630923762b43b2f77a754336", "ja": "内容を思い出せなかったとしても、\n今から新しく考えて、十分間に合うよ。", "zh": "就算想不起内容，现在重新想一个，也完全来得及。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2002_036kan", "source_sha256": "69390d2a9fe9bd79c435dd32e8e5cd0226af006ee06090e54196397fd506e4eb", "ja": "そ、そうですよね。ほっ……。\nこの世の終わりかと思っちゃいました。", "zh": "对、对啊。呼……  \n我还以为世界末日要来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2003_p", "source_sha256": "752143e66d2d0f77ee678bd00a66446232921c7f6cadff6fdb0c5ec4c9a73480", "ja": "珍しく、随分緊張してるんだな。\nもう、前ほどしなくなってきたと思ったのに……。", "zh": "难得见你这么紧张啊。\n我还以为你已经不像以前那么紧张了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2004_036kan", "source_sha256": "ac3283d8d615ea9b01dd7c0561851fc2e6d90c2b4f6d6a4404f0b86a120e7cf4", "ja": "すみません……私も、ちょっとは慣れてきたかな～？\nなんて思ってたんですけど。", "zh": "对不起……我还以为自己多少已经习惯一点了呢～？可没想到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2005_036kan", "source_sha256": "b37ce91d31c87f11f98b4e0677c50a6b2fb5b62f4ba2f01ed704e755ce574789", "ja": "最近、亜利沙さんと恵美さんと、\n3人でいっしょにいることが多かったので……。", "zh": "最近经常和亚利沙、恵美她们3个人待在一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2006_036kan", "source_sha256": "1ac9c42d3259b4473e06690d8455c280be86f4a9a8a12c3314308d5702f7b0b0", "ja": "今日はひとりのお仕事なんだ……って思ったら、\n急に、心細くなっちゃって……。", "zh": "想到今天要一个人工作……就突然觉得有点不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2007_p", "source_sha256": "01d4a9e85d99d1c39eccb75dbba87717560d3268c059f193d55a8d6f89fed0e0", "ja": "なるほど、そういう事か。たしかに\nライブの前後は、ほぼ毎日3人一緒に行動してたしな。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么回事啊。确实，演出前后，几乎每天都和3人一起行动来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2008_036kan", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2009_p", "source_sha256": "e8fb213f3d15e9c0e7b2166bf671f4788c0c7ebaf776a0c8b85a3859647e9182", "ja": "なら、そうだな……挨拶の内容を、\n恵美と亜利沙に相談してみたらどうかな。", "zh": "那就这样吧……要不要去和惠美、亚利沙商量一下问候的内容？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2010_036kan", "source_sha256": "55b4c35a3b3d88ee6cf6fd72cba69859bea907ed54f3edb55b76fe34d1b726a1", "ja": "えっ！？　で、でも、ふたりとも\n今日は別のお仕事なんじゃ……。", "zh": "诶！？可、可是，她们两个今天不是有别的工作吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2011_p", "source_sha256": "3c9612944721f8eba2f1a7f078a6068198a330eedccd9ce72502e4388d69640e", "ja": "あっちは朝からだったから、\nそろそろ劇場に戻ってる頃だと思うよ。", "zh": "她们那边是一大早开始的，\n我想差不多该回剧场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2012_036kan", "source_sha256": "7cb20905c48304388324a841032f4905cdd4a7e6c562bae2bfffeca8c234e048", "ja": "そ、そうなんですか。でも……うぅ……。\nあの、やっぱり、ちょっと電話してみますっ！", "zh": "是、是这样啊。不过……呜呜……那个，我还是打个电话试试吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2013_null", "source_sha256": "26bad7a9a0e63c7b8e956ffc3986f65b4a48ad74c64be68c4f7a5220d7922633", "ja": "30分後……", "zh": "30分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0673_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0673_2014_036kan", "source_sha256": "21a200d1f753f7b3959445355e9b0293b3ee585aa81eb34b18ffe54ed78be58a", "ja": "それじゃ{$P$}さん、いってきます！\n『≡君彩≡』のCD、たくさん売っちゃいますよ～♪", "zh": "那么，{$P$}先生，我出发啦！\n我要卖出好多《≡君彩≡》的CD哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
